<?php require_once __DIR__.'/includes/functions.php'; page_start('About StudySync'); ?><div class="row py-5"><div class="col-lg-8"><div class="eyebrow">ABOUT US</div><h1 class="display-5 fw-bold">Learning is better when it is shared.</h1><p class="lead text-secondary">StudySync is a student-focused platform for finding peers who can help you learn and who want to learn alongside you.</p><h2 class="h4 mt-5">Why StudySync exists</h2><p>Finding the right person to study with can be difficult. StudySync brings student interests, skills, learning goals, and availability together so that learners can discover compatible peers and organize focused study sessions.</p><h2 class="h4 mt-4">How matching works</h2><p>Matches use visible, understandable factors: shared subjects, complementary help and learning interests, overlapping skills, study mode, availability, course, and semester. The score is a guide for discovery, not a guarantee of compatibility.</p><h2 class="h4 mt-4">A community built by students</h2><p>Students can connect one to one, form topic groups, share feedback after collaboration, and report behavior that does not belong in a supportive learning community.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="register.php">Create your profile</a></div></div><?php page_end(); ?>
